      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Barricade as many open floor tiles as possible before the level''s timer
    runs out. Prevent friendly robots from falling through them and don''t fall through
    yourself!

    Some levels have enemy robots that attack you when in range. Lure
    them into open tiles or avoid them, but getting hit costs you points!

    Levels
    with enemies also include a puzzle.  Complete it to freeze enemy robots for 30
    seconds and gain bonus points. Solve it as many times as you like!

    Between
    levels, a mini-game challenges you to select the right PPE for each situation.
    Nail it for even more bonus points!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
